id: nt_okujou
name: Okujou
description: Okujou. An original rooftop complex composed for this game rather than traced from anything: a helipad deck, a glazed penthouse, a plant deck, and a light well through the middle that every route has to go round.
grid: 1.7
wall_thickness: 0.3

layer ground z=0 height=6.0 roof=no

